# Internet Browser (NPXS10003): every screen reached from its first page, back, PS button / Continue, close, open again
# (tests/nav/sysapps, build/sysapps-sweep.ps1; expected results in docs/notes/system-apps.md, Sweep checklist)
wait 600
press cross
wait 200
swipe 0.93 0.12 0.3 0.7 30
wait 400
press cross
wait 100
log open browser 1
tap 0.73 0.24
wait 150
press circle
wait 60
shot gate1
tap 0.75 0.52
wait 500
shot main1
log bookmark
tap 0.5 0.37
wait 900
shot bookmark
# no network: the web engine (NPXS10083) answers with "Cannot display the page" (C2-14921-7); OK closes it
tap 0.5 0.82
wait 120
shot error_ok
press circle
wait 300
log back
wait 10
shot back
log ps
press psbutton
wait 300
shot ps1
log continue
tap 0.75 0.52
wait 300
shot resumed
press psbutton
wait 300
log close
swipe 0.97 0.04 0.3 0.7 30
wait 300
shot closed1
# back on the home screen: close its first-run hint (it comes back after a close)
tap 0.146 0.2
wait 100
shot home2
log open browser 2
tap 0.73 0.24
wait 150
shot gate2
tap 0.75 0.52
wait 500
shot main2
press psbutton
wait 300
shot ps2
swipe 0.97 0.04 0.3 0.7 30
wait 300
shot closed2
quit
